<title>USA: Washington National Corp Q1 net, oper rise.</title>
<headline>Washington National Corp Q1 net, oper rise.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLNSHIRE, Ill. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.77		    $0.43</p>
<p> Net			  9,806		    5,434</p>
<p> Revs			83,023		   80,705</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	12,554		   12,397</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net operating income from continuing operations for Q1 1997 was $7.765 million or $0.61 a share, versus $7.283 million or $0.58 a share. Q1 1996 includes an after-tax loss of $1.244 million from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
